          "title": "You'll want to know: నవ్వు",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నవ్వు (navvu) — \"a laugh\", and \"a smile\": Telugu uses one word for both."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "నవ్వండి — \"smile!\", with the polite ending, what a photographer says."
            }
          ]
        },
